{"id":"4d1699b2d03d166c","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-godel-ordinal-chain.md","title":"Gödel Residuated Ordinal Chain","display":"df-godel-ordinal-chain — Gödel Residuated Ordinal Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-godel-ordinal-chain","aliases":["93-df-godel-ordinal-chain"],"display":"df-godel-ordinal-chain — Gödel Residuated Ordinal Chain","depends_on":["[[93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-godel-ordinal-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-godel-ordinal-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-ordinal-chain — Gödel Residuated Ordinal Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"666476cf8bc960fb\" href=\"?note=666476cf8bc960fb\" title=\"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid\">93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the ambient class of ordinals and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\alpha}\">\\(A_{\\alpha}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes_{\\alpha}\">\\(\\otimes_{\\alpha}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}\">\\(\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nA_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nA_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\otimes_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\nx,&amp;x\\leq y,\\\\\ny,&amp;y&lt;x\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in A_{\\alpha}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\otimes_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\nx,&amp;x\\leq y,\\\\\ny,&amp;y&lt;x\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in A_{\\alpha}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\n\\alpha,&amp;x\\leq y,\\\\\ny,&amp;y&lt;x\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in A_{\\alpha}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\n\\alpha,&amp;x\\leq y,\\\\\ny,&amp;y&lt;x\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in A_{\\alpha}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\n\\bigl(\\otimes_{\\alpha}:A_{\\alpha}^{2}\\to A_{\\alpha}\n\\land\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}:A_{\\alpha}^{2}\\to A_{\\alpha}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\n\\bigl(\\otimes_{\\alpha}:A_{\\alpha}^{2}\\to A_{\\alpha}\n\\land\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}:A_{\\alpha}^{2}\\to A_{\\alpha}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>These are explicit function graphs for the Gödel t-norm and its residual on the bounded ordinal segment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\alpha}=\\alpha+1\">\\(A_{\\alpha}=\\alpha+1\\)</span>; their values outside that carrier are not silently assumed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid","status":"resolved","id":"666476cf8bc960fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"0<\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\otimes_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nA_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\otimes_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\nx,&x\\leq y,\\\\\ny,&y<x\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in A_{\\alpha}\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\n\\alpha,&x\\leq y,\\\\\ny,&y<x\n\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in A_{\\alpha}\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n0<\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\n\\bigl(\\otimes_{\\alpha}:A_{\\alpha}^{2}\\to A_{\\alpha}\n\\land\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}:A_{\\alpha}^{2}\\to A_{\\alpha}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A_{\\alpha}=\\alpha+1","display":false}],"bytes":1509,"backlinks":[{"id":"a3b65a6dbc3cc9fd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A_{\\alpha}$, $\\otimes_{\\alpha}$, and $\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}$ are the exact constructors of [[93-df-godel-ordinal-chain]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-godel-ordinal-chain]]"}],"outgoing":["666476cf8bc960fb"]}